--
Returning a class (here std::pair) by value move-constructs the result via the
defaulted move constructor.  CBMC must generate the memberwise body for the
defaulted *move* constructor (rvalue-reference parameter), not only the copy
constructor, and for class-typed members, otherwise the returned object is left
nondet.
